cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the method papers listed under references."
type: software
title: "PyWirewalker: Python processing for Wirewalker CTD and Doppler sonar data"
abstract: >-
  Processing pipelines for RBR CTD loggers and Nortek Signature Doppler sonars carried on the
  wave-powered Wirewalker profiler. Raw instrument files are converted through a staged L0-L3
  archive of self-describing NetCDF products, including motion-corrected velocity and shear, and
  turbulent kinetic energy dissipation from the high-resolution vertical beam.
